<title>DUBAI: Saudi Aramco revises bunker fuel prices.</title>
<headline>Saudi Aramco revises bunker fuel prices.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Aramco has reduced A-960 bunker fuel prices from Ras Tanura and Dammam by $1 a tonne to $103 a tonne ($15.81 a barrel) with effect June 26, it said.</p>
<p>A-960 from the Red Sea ports of Jeddah and Yanbu is reduced $5 to $94 a tonne ($14.43).</p>
<p>A-888 bunker diesel from Ras Tanura and Dammam is cut $5 to $199 a tonne and unchanged at $180 a tonne from Red Sea ports.</p>
</text>
